SUBJECT:
Revised Map for Swan Ranch 10th Filing (UDC-17-00145)
Dear City Councilmembers and Madam Mayor,
The City of Cheyenne Development Department has received a revised county final plat map for Swan
Ranch
0th Filing, which was Item #21 on the last City Council agenda for the meeting held on
4/10/2017. The application will be considered by the Public Services Commfttee at the regularly
scheduled meeting on 4/18/2017.
Previously, Development Department Staff and the Planning Commission recommended the application
be approved without additional conditions. The applicant made a change to the map to address
comments made by County reviewers. Staff continues to recommend approval of this application without
conditions. Staff recommends that an amendment by substitute be made to include attached map.
The updated final plat map has been provided to Kris Jones, Executive Assistant to the City Council, for
distribution and is also attached to this memorandum. Seth Lloyd is the case planner for this project. If
you have any questions regarding this memorandum or Swan Ranch 10th Filing, please contact Seth or I
by either phone or email. Seth is available at 307-637-6286 or slloyd@cheyennecity.org.
Regards,
Eric Hammer
Planner
ehammer@cheyennecity.org
(307) 638-4342
